        <db-field|date|1714665270>
      <|db-entry>
        <db-field|author|Bjoern <name|Bringmann><name-sep>Sky <name|Cao>>

        <db-field|title|Global well-posedness of the stochastic Abelian-Higgs
        equations in two dimensions>

        <db-field|year|2024>

        <db-field|number|arXiv:2403.16878>

        <db-field|eprint|2403.16878>

        <db-field|primaryclass|math-ph>

        <db-field|publisher|arXiv>

        <db-field|doi|10.48550/arXiv.2403.16878>

        <db-field|urldate|2024-05-02>

        <db-field|abstract|We prove the global well-posedness of the
        stochastic Abelian-Higgs equations in two dimensions. The proof is
        based on a new covariant approach, which consists of two parts:
        First, we introduce covariant stochastic objects. The covariant
        stochastic objects and their multi-linear interactions are controlled
        using covariant heat kernel estimates. Second, we control nonlinear
        remainders using a covariant monotonicity formula, which is inspired
        by earlier work of Hamilton.>

        <db-field|archiveprefix|arxiv>

        <db-field|keywords|35R60 60H17,Mathematical Physics,Mathematics -
        Analysis of PDEs,Mathematics - Probability>

        <db-field|journal|arXiv preprint arXiv:2403.16878>
      </db-entry>

